  "notes": "{返済|へんさい} is used for formal repayment of loans, debts, and borrowed money.\n\nVERBAL USE:\n{返済|へんさい}する: to repay, to pay back\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {返済|へんさい}{期間|きかん}: repayment period\n- {返済|へんさい}{計画|けいかく}: repayment plan\n- {返済|へんさい}{能力|のうりょく}: repayment capacity\n- {早期|そうき}{返済|へんさい}: early repayment\n- {一括|いっかつ}{返済|へんさい}: lump-sum repayment\n- {分割|ぶんかつ}{返済|へんさい}: installment repayment\n\nRELATED FINANCIAL TERMS:\n- {融資|ゆうし}: financing, loan\n- {借金|しゃっきん}: debt (casual)\n- {負債|ふさい}: liabilities (accounting)\n- ローン: loan (loanword)\n\nREGISTER: Formal/business vocabulary.",
